      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹5.01 (vs ₹2.91 loss in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹5.01 (up from ₹2.91 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹37.3m (up 21% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹3.35m (up ₹5.30m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 9.0% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 31% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 43% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
